  "description": "The native payload for Agora's software video encoder extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_iOS 4.6.2 archive and packaged for .NET for iOS. The software H.264/H.265 encoder, used when the device's hardware encoder is unavailable or unusable for the requested profile. Two frameworks: the extension and the codec it wraps. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.iOS or Net.Agora.Voice.iOS — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is selected by the engine itself once present in the RTC binding.",
